{"id":"c210338b489f6670","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure.md","title":"随机归约保持BPP可判定性","display":"prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure — 随机归约保持BPP可判定性","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure","aliases":["28-prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure"],"display":"prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure — 随机归约保持BPP可判定性","depends_on":["[[28-df-randomized-reduction]]","[[28-df-bpp]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §7.6 paragraph after Definition 7.16","source_printed_pages":"138","source_pdf_pages":"164","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure — 随机归约保持BPP可判定性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e80fbecaa53ce67\" href=\"?note=2e80fbecaa53ce67\" title=\"28-df-randomized-reduction\">28-df-randomized-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §7.6 paragraph after Definition 7.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"138"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"164"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_r\">\\(\\le_r\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e80fbecaa53ce67\" href=\"?note=2e80fbecaa53ce67\" title=\"28-df-randomized-reduction\">28-df-randomized-reduction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BPP}\">\\(\\mathbf{BPP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\le_r C\\land C\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\Longrightarrow B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\le_r C\\land C\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\Longrightarrow B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先独立重复C的BPP算法1000次取多数。若单次成功至少2/3，独立成功次数S的方差至多250，多数出错时偏差至少1000/6，故用E[(S−ES)²]界尾概率得错误≤9/1000&lt;1/12。随机映射一次再调用此求解器，整体正确率至少2/3−1/12=7/12。再独立重复这个组合1000次，多数错误概率≤250/(1000/12)²=0.036&lt;1/3。归约输出长度多项式且重复次数固定，运行时间仍多项式。这里完整保留两层误差预算，未把2/3乘11/12误写成至少2/3。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§7.6 paragraph after Definition 7.16；印刷 pp.138 / PDF pp.164。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-randomized-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"2e80fbecaa53ce67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-randomized-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bpp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-randomized-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"2e80fbecaa53ce67","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$；$\\le_r$ 见 [[28-df-randomized-reduction]]；$\\mathbf{BPP}$ 见 [[28-df-bpp]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$；$\\le_r$ 见 [[28-df-randomized-reduction]]；$\\mathbf{BPP}$ 见 [[28-df-bpp]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BPP}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\le_r C\\land C\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\Longrightarrow B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}.","display":true}],"bytes":1723,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-bptime]]、[[28-df-randomized-reduction]]、[[28-prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure]]、[[28-lem-von-neumann-unbiasing]]、[[28-lem-computable-biased-coin]]、[[28-df-randomized-space-machine]]、[[28-df-bpl-rl]]。"}],"outgoing":["2e80fbecaa53ce67","073a1a66749fa84e"]}